    <item>Upstream dependencies for the selected Hessian identification
    remain the attached metric, floor and sworn hypotheses explicitly present
    in the theorem. The scalar-factor comparison for those conditions is
    parent-owned.
  </itemize-minus>

  <section|Review boundaries><label|review-boundaries>

  This draft is awaiting the final independent reread of the finite division
  and mixed-response conversion. The most recent edits remove a duplicate
  Hessian explanation, state explicitly that ray order implies the Taylor
  vanishing needed for division, and retain periodicity as a hypothesis on
  the input picture entries. No claim of a full Yang--Mills proof or of
  <verbatim|tideMark> closure is made beyond this bounded unit.

